# NOT a release record, NOT executable deployment instructions. No fixed revision exists yet.
# Preserve the checkpoint stash; commit/release/image activation require separate authorization.
SP_RELEASE_ID=candidate-a
ARK_GAME_PORT=3120
ARK_ASSETS_PORT=3130
ARK_AUTH_PORT=3140
# Required new immutable image coordinates: leave empty until exact source and contents are verified.
ARK_GAME_IMAGE=
ARK_GATEWAY_IMAGE=
ARK_AUTH_IMAGE=
ARK_ASSETS_IMAGE=
ARK_ROLLING_PRIVATE_DIR=/opt/ark-proto/rolling/private
ARK_ASSET_MANIFEST=/opt/ark-proto/rolling/material/candidate-a/openi-assets.json
ARK_AUTH_SECRETS_FILE=/opt/ark-proto/auth-secrets/gate.json
# Manual preparation ONLY AFTER authorization, never from Compose automatically:
# umask 077
# install -d -o 1000 -g 1000 -m 0700 "$ARK_ROLLING_PRIVATE_DIR"
# Review/substitute gateway.json.example and registry.json.example, then install each as
# UID1000:GID1000 mode0600 gateway.json / registry.json in the private directory.
# All ancestors must be real directories (no symlink); never chmod /run or mount it wholesale.
# state.json is created durably as0600 by gateway in that same0700 dir: NEVER preseed or overwrite it.
# Socket files are0600. Same UID1000 is required across gateway + game containers.
# Never delete a stale socket blindly: verify listener/PID ownership and absence first, manually.
# Use a DIFFERENT release ID/project/image/game port/resolver port for every new release.
# gateway.json candidate port3190 avoids live game3108. Stable3108 replacement is first-maintenance-only.
# Existing legacy resolver3110 remains active;3111 is warming, not proof of active routing.
# New auth3140 and material resolver3130 are staging coordinates; do not restart old3109/3110/3111.
# Templates contain no automatic activate/retire/kill, no production commands, no credentials.
